oS", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53235, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LvAzrQpgy1En4EEJNw3voS", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54463, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TV9BHVwd5wV2ZieGJz8GQG", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54763, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TV9BHVwd5wV2ZieGJz8GQG", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54763, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TV9BHVwd5wV2ZieGJz8GQG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58954, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and opened the SEV2 incident. The service is passing health checks again.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. The faulty v2.3.1 and the v2.3.1-rc release before it were both failing. The first rollback stopped with an orchestrator error after only us-east had switched to v2.3.0. A second attempt finished the job.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api), which paged on-call. It describes the failing deploy, the rollback, the partial failure and the follow-ups. The request to create it timed out, but the incident list showed it had been created, so I didn't send it again and there's only one incident.\n\n**Follow-ups noted in the incident:** find out why v2.3.1 failed and what caused the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NgN34UrD2VbsEQ1rSdX4cf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Jo4HBr6azko4qSAe9LFRBq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01NR7mVPfG9RXSj72cXdurkh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DcWinBMSZ9TwcZgSxVJJFK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Trying the rollback again, since it moves every region to the same target version.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01M8UWzaEeKFJe28Tkq8p5TW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019NAJg5kkgAKQL7CoWYD9cu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LKEegJjiaMmqnhkvYb5ZPj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "c