ollow-ups. The request to create it timed out, but the incident list showed it had been created, so I didn't send it again and there's only one incident.\n\n**Follow-ups noted in the incident:** find out why v2.3.1 failed and what caused the orchestrator error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}